  "notes": "{再開|さいかい} means to resume or restart something that was interrupted or stopped. It applies to activities, operations, services, and events — not to machines or devices (use ⟦{再起動|さいきどう}→再起動：09222_saikidou⟧ for those).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Both: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{再開|さいかい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to resume ~) and 〜⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{再開|さいかい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (~ resumes); the passive 〜⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{再開|さいかい}⟦される→する：00392_suru⟧ is also common.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {再開|さいかい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{決|き}める→決める：00858_kimeru⟧: to decide to resume\n- {再開|さいかい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{求|もと}める→求める：02316_motomeru⟧: to demand resumption\n- 〜⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{再開|さいかい}: resumption of ~\n\nWATCH OUT:\n⟦{再会|さいかい}→再会：11667_saikai⟧ (reunion — meeting someone again) uses different kanji and has a completely different meaning. Be careful not to confuse them.",
